  "notes": "Cohere calls it the smallest, fastest and final model of its R series. It opens a new small tier rather than continuing an earlier one, so no predecessor relation is recorded. Cohere's Command A technical report also covers Command R7B and says the two share capability and architectural similarities. The models overview lists no cloud-platform ids for it (N/A on Bedrock, SageMaker, Azure AI Foundry and OCI)."
